      <li><a href={href("/research")}>Research summary</a> and <a href={href("/models-data")}>model card</a>.</li>
      <li>IPBES (2016), Summary for Policymakers of the assessment report on pollinators, pollination and food production. <a href="https://files.ipbes.net/ipbes-web-prod-public-files/spm_deliverable_3a_pollination_20170222.pdf" rel="noopener">PDF</a>. Accessed 12 Nov 2026.</li>
      <li>Gray et al. (2019), COLOSS winter 2017/18 loss rates. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1080/00218839.2019.1615661" rel="noopener">doi:10.1080/00218839.2019.1615661</a>. Accessed 12 Nov 2026.</li>
      <li>Brodschneider et al. (2018), COLOSS winter 2016/17 loss rates. <a href="https://strathprints.strath.ac.uk/64589/1/Brodschneider_etal_JAR_2018_Multi_country_loss_rates_of_honey_bee_colonies_during_winter.pdf" rel="noopener">PDF</a>. Accessed 12 Nov 2026.</li>
